{"speciesId":101,"names":{"fr":"Électrode","es":"Electrode","en":"Electrode","ja":"マルマイン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Stores electrical energy inside its body. Even the slightest shock could trigger a huge explosion."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is dangerous. If it has too much electricity and has nothing to do, it amuses itself by exploding."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It stores an over­ flowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The more energy it charges up, the faster it gets. But this also makes it more likely to explode."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ELECTRODE eats electricity in the atmosphere. On days when lightning strikes, you can see this POKéMON exploding all over the place from eating too much electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"One of ELECTRODE’s characteristics is its attraction to electricity. It is a problematical POKéMON that congregates mostly at electrical power plants to feed on electricity that has just been generated."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they feed on electricity, they cause massive and chaotic blackouts in nearby cities."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It explodes in response to even minor stimuli. It is feared, with the nickname of “The Bomb Ball.”"},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is dangerous. If it has too much electricity and has nothing to do, it amuses itself by exploding."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se laisse porter par les vents lorsque son corps est gonflé d’électricité à en éclater."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se laisse porter par les vents lorsque son corps est gonflé d’électricité à en éclater."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il explose au moindre choc. Son seul surnom de « Bomb Ball » suffit à effrayer ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Explotan a la mínima. Por eso se les tiene mucho miedo. Estos Pokémon reciben el mote de Bomba Ball."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It explodes in response to even minor stimuli. It is feared, with the nickname of “The Bomb Ball.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"少しの 刺激に 反応して 爆発する。バクダンボールという あだ名で 怖がられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il stocke tellement d’énergie dans son corps qu’une simple secousse peut le faire exploser."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Almacena una enorme cantidad de electricidad en su cuerpo. Una pequeña sacudida le hará explotar."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"あふれるほどの 電気エネルギーを 体内に ためこんでいるので 少しの 刺激で 爆発する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Électrode mange l’électricité qui se trouve dans l’atmosphère. Les jours d’orage, on peut voir ce Pokémon exploser sans arrêt parce qu’il a avalé trop d’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Los Electrode se alimentan de la electricidad de la atmósfera. En días de tormenta con rayos, es fácil verlos explotando por todos lados tras haber consumido demasiada electricidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Electrode eats electricity in the atmosphere. On days when lightning strikes, you can see this Pokémon exploding all over the place from eating too much electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"空気中の 電気エネルギーを 食べる。 カミナリの 落ちる 日は 電気を 食べ過ぎた マルマインが あちらこちらで 大爆発する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"L’une des caractéristiques d’Électrode est son attirance pour l’électricité. Ces Pokémon posent problème lorsqu’ils se rassemblent dans les centrales électriques pour se nourrir de courant fraîchement généré."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Una de las características de Electrode es la atracción que siente hacia la electricidad. Son Pokémon problemáticos que suelen agruparse cerca de centrales eléctricas para nutrirse de la energía recién generada."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"One of Electrode’s characteristics is its attraction to electricity. It is a problematical Pokémon that congregates mostly at electrical power plants to feed on electricity that has just been generated."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"電気に 引き寄せられる 性質を 持つ。 主に 発電所に 集まってきて つくった ばかりの 電気を 食べてしまう 困りものだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il stocke de l’énergie électrique dans son corps, ce qui le rend instable et explosif."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Almacena tal cantidad de energía eléctrica en su cuerpo que el más leve impacto puede provocar una gran explosión."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Stores electrical energy inside its body. Even the slightest shock could trigger a huge explosion."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"少しでも 衝撃を 与えると 体内の エレクトンエネルギーが あふれて 爆発 してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il stocke de l’énergie électrique dans son corps, ce qui le rend instable et explosif."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Almacena tal cantidad de energía eléctrica en su cuerpo que el más leve impacto puede provocar una gran explosión."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Stores electrical energy inside its body. Even the slightest shock could trigger a huge explosion."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"少しでも 衝撃を 与えると 体内の エレクトンエネルギーが あふれて 爆発 してしまう。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"The tissue on the surface of its body is curiously similar in composition to an Apricorn. When irritated, this Pokémon lets loose an electric current equal to 20 lightning bolts."}],"varieties":[{"id":101,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",5],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",5],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",5],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",5],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"l